  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Start Deck Magmortar, one of four 30-card half decks released together on 20 November 2009 to mark the Japanese national qualifiers for the Pokémon World Championships 2010, so that newcomers could pick a style of play and enter. Its theme is attack: Numel and other cards back Magmortar up to deal big damage. Each deck has one holo card and a quick guide to playing.",
